; The machine's own pilot lamp, behind the bezel. It flares on a payout, and the
; rest of the time it is what keeps the brass gearbox on the unlit flank from
; disappearing — the key light comes from the far side and never reaches it.
; A second, cooler fill from the front and above, aimed across the works along
; the top of the chassis. The room's one bulb is behind and to the right of the
; machine, so the brass gearing it drives was the least lit thing on it.
[node name="Sparks" type="CPUParticles3D" parent="."]
